mization"},{"text":"Linear programming"},{"text":"Quadratic programming"},{"text":"Constrained optimization"},{"text":"Lagrange multipliers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Stochastic Mathematics"},{"type":"p","text":"For advanced quant roles:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Brownian motion"},{"text":"Martingales"},{"text":"Stochastic processes"},{"text":"Ito's lemma"},{"text":"Stochastic differential equations"}]}]},{"heading":"Programming & Quantitative Computing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Importance"],"rows":[[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Essential"}],[{"text":"C++"},{"text":"Highly valuable"}],[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Highly useful"}],[{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"Essential"}],[{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"Essential"}],[{"text":"SciPy"},{"text":"Highly useful"}],[{"text":"Jupyter"},{"text":"Highly useful"}],[{"text":"Git"},{"text":"Essential"}],[{"text":"Linux"},{"text":"Highly useful"}],[{"text":"C"},{"text":"Useful"}],[{"text":"R"},{"text":"Optional"}],[{"text":"MATLAB"},{"text":"Useful"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Python Applications"},{"type":"p","text":"Use Python for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market-data processing"},{"text":"Statistical analysis"},{"text":"Backtesting"},{"text":"Portfolio optimization"},{"text":"Machine learning"},{"text":"Risk modeling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"C++ Applications"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"High-performance computing"},{"text":"Algorithmic trading"},{"text":"Low-latency systems"},{"text":"Trading infrastructure"},{"text":"Quantitative libraries"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Algorithmic Trading Backtester"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a backtesting engine using historical market data."},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Entry rules"},{"text":"Exit rules"},{"text":"Position sizing"},{"text":"Transaction costs"},{"text":"Slippage"},{"text":"Performance metrics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Measure:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CAGR"},{"text":"Sharpe ratio"},{"text":"Maximum drawdown"},{"text":"Win rate"},{"text":"Volatility"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Portfolio Optimization"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a portfolio optimizer using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Expected returns"},{"text":"Covariance matrix"},{"text":"Risk constraints"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Implement:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Minimum-variance portfolio"},{"text":"Maximum-Sharpe portfolio"},{"text":"Efficient frontier"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Options Pricing Engine"},{"type":"p","text":"Implement:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Binomial option pricing"},{"text":"Black-Scholes pricing"},{"text":"Monte Carlo pricing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Calculate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Option price"},{"text":"Delta"},{"text":"Gamma"},{"text":"Vega"},{"text":"Theta"},{"text":"Compare model outputs."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Volatility Forecasting"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a time-series model to forecast market volatility."},{"type":"p","text":"Compare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Historical volatility"},{"text":"Moving-average methods"},{"text":"GARCH-type models"},{"text":"Machine-learning approaches"},{"text":"Evaluate using out-of-sample data."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Statistical Arbitrage"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a research project around:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pairs trading"},{"text":"Cointegration"},{"text":"Mean reversion"},{"text":"Z-scores"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Carefully test:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Training period"},{"text":"Validation period"},{"text":"Transaction costs"},{"text":"Out-of-sample performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — Market Risk Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a dashboard showing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Portfolio value"},{"text":"Daily P&L"},{"text":"Volatility"},{"text":"Sharpe ratio"},{"text":"VaR"},{"text":"Drawdown"},{"text":"Asset exposure"},{"text":"Sector exposure"},{"text":"Use Python/SQL/Power BI."}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FinTech startups"},{"text":"Data science internships"},{"text":"Software engineering internships"},{"text":"Research assistantships"},{"text":"The first internship does not necessarily need to be in finance."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial analytics"},{"text":"Risk analytics"},{"text":"Data science"},{"text":"Quantitative research internships"},{"text":"Trading technology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3"},{"type":"p","text":"This is the most important internship stage."},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Quant Research Intern"},{"text":"Quantitative Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Algorithmic Trading Intern"},{"text":"Quant Developer Intern"},{"text":"Risk Quant Intern"},{"text":"Systematic Trading Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final Year"},{"type":"p","text":"Target organizations with work involving:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market modeling"},{"text":"Quantitative research"},{"text":"Derivatives"},{"text":"Algorithmic trading"},{"text":"Portfolio optimization"},{"text":"Risk modeling"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For top quant roles, internships at strong quantitative trading firms, hedge funds, banks, or research-oriented financial institutions can be particularly valuable."}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After graduation, target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Quantitative Analyst"},{"text":"Quant Research Analyst"},{"text":"Quantitative Developer"},{"text":"Quantitative Risk Analyst"},{"text":"Algorithmic Trading Analyst"},{"text":"Financial Data Scientist"},{"text":"Risk Analyst"},{"text":"Derivatives Analyst"},{"text":"Portfolio Analytics Analyst"},{"t